  "acceptance_observations": [
    "CD.J10 runs ten exact base IDCAMS refresh jobs plus DEFGDGB and DALYREJS through the public z/OSMF job route. The resulting catalog receipt covers base PS/KSDS data, PDS procedure/control/JCL members, AIX paths, and all seven required GDG generation families.",
    "CD.J11 runs CLOSEFIL, POSTTRAN, INTCALC, and OPENFIL against the shared online authority. POSTTRAN returns CC 0004 with exactly 300 processed and 38 rejected transactions; all five CICS files persist CLOSED then OPEN state, and account, transaction, reject, balance, and system-transaction bytes are included in the exact dataset receipt.",
    "CD.J12 runs backup, combine, transaction AIX, report, category report, and the hash-pinned CREASTMT correction. CBSTM03A and CBSTM03B execute reached linkage, ALTER, multidimensional table, control-block-addressing, file cursor, and numeric-edited paths; statement text/HTML, reports, SORT products, master/AIX, and GDG generations are nonempty and byte-digested.",
    "INTRDRJ1 submits INTRDRJ2 through the internal reader; the child drains to OUTPUT CC 0000 and reproduces the FTP backup byte-exactly. A held job cancels through the public z/OSMF PUT route, and a failing step removes its DISP abnormal-delete allocation.",
    "All dataset, catalog, job state, JES/JOBLOG/SYSPRINT and named DD spool digests plus the five OPEN file states remain identical after graceful shutdown and warm restart. The CD-022 artifact receipt was refreshed because newly reached CD-023 semantics changed the content-addressed artifact shape without changing its counts or acceptance status."
  ],
